<title>ECUADOR: TENNIS-ECUADOR BEAT 4-1 URUGUAY IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ECUADOR BEAT 4-1 URUGUAY IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador won both reverse singles to complete a 4-1 victory over Uruguay in their Davis Cup American Zone group two final tie in Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Ecuador names first):</p>
<p>Nicolas Lapenti beat Marcelo Filippini 6-4 6-3 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Luis Adrian Morejon beat Federico Dondo 6-4 6-1</p>
